    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77802" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά-βλημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is thrown beside</i> or <i>before,
			fodder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1406.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>curtain</i> or <i>screen used to cover</i> the sides of
			ships, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.1.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Geom.,
				<i>rectangle applied to a straight line</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Con.Sph.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, al.</div>
